# Wave W17-X (Route 212 — North): pool sand — the drowning road’s sand, design-authorised: a pale sand that runs to the pools’ edges and stops there, slightly greyed by the wet it keeps meeting (design: the road south runs on through the wet pools to Fenland; bring boots you have already forgiven). Split from Route 212 — South’s dry-line sand by the grey entire: this sand is drowning, that sand admitted defeat and walks the dry line.
